NAME
       whoami - print the user name you are working as

SYNOPSIS
       whoami

DESCRIPTION
       whoami prints the name of the effective user: the one whose rights the
       commands you type have now. After su or sudo -i it names the new user,
       not the one who logged in. id shows the same plus the groups.

EXAMPLES
           whoami

SEE ALSO
       id(1), who(1), logname(1)
